{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_town005_kanban_01",
      "hash": "e9b56ce052d8e502",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这里是紫苑镇。\\n紫苑即是气质高贵的紫兰之色。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_town005_kanban_02",
      "hash": "e9b56be052d8e34f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能看到肉眼看不见的宝可梦？\\n新产品！西尔佛检视镜！\\c\\n……西尔佛公司"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_town005_kanban_03",
      "hash": "e9b56ae052d8e19c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "爱心志愿者聚首于此。\\n宝可梦之家"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_town005_kanban_04",
      "hash": "e9b569e052d8dfe9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宝可梦灵魂的安息之塔。\\n宝可梦塔"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_town005_juveniles_01_01",
      "hash": "dd108a5f7ce63432",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你相信世界上真的有幽灵吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_town005_juveniles_01_02",
      "hash": "dd10895f7ce6327f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……噢～\\n原来真的有人相信幽灵存在呀～"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_town005_juveniles_01_03",
      "hash": "dd10885f7ce630cc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈哈哈！我也这么觉得！\\c\\n刚才我还觉得你的右肩上\\n搭着一只手……\\r\\n那一定是我看错了吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_town005_adultm_01",
      "hash": "85160d0b0641adba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这个镇子\\n因宝可梦的坟墓而闻名……\\c\\n在自己养育的宝可梦去世之后，\\n人们会把它带到宝可梦塔里，\\r\\n为之祈祷冥福……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_town005_youngm_01",
      "hash": "992c8d4ceabdd3c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "听说最近宝可梦塔里\\n有幽灵出没啊……\\c\\n我猜那八成是\\n被火箭队带走后失踪的\\r\\n宝可梦的幽灵……"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_town005_oldf_01",
      "hash": "2d0312137a06f17c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊……\\n熏香的香味太治愈了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_town005_poke_01",
      "hash": "575f74472b704770",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "尼多兰：香香～"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_town005_childf_01",
      "hash": "e3b08901e734d73f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在宝可梦塔里\\n不可以喧哗哦！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_town005_max",
      "hash": "28597b37fbf817c7"
    }
  ]
}
